{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p002c","title":"苑康改荀淑旧居里为高阳里","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p002c-account","label":"张璠《汉纪》","text":"苑康改荀淑旧居里为高阳里","evidence":["xunyu-e-p002c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0015","role":"改里名","evidence":["xunyu-e-p002c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"荀淑荀爽仕汉时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xunyu-e-p002c-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-p002c-q","source_order":[10,18,"P002c"],"order":2391}],"persons":[{"id":"xunyu-p0015","name":"苑康","evidence":["xunyu-q-p002","dongyuan-q-p109"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xunyu-m-p002-xunyu-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-p002"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p109-xunyu-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p109"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-q-p109","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-8c13365348655e1e7588","layer":"pei","quote":"表与汝南陈翔字仲麟、范滂字孟博、鲁国孔昱字世元、勃海苑康字仲真、山阳檀敷字文友、张俭字元节、南阳岑晊字公孝为‘八友’。","attribution":"《汉末名士录》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":468,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-79d1d1dad564a618e84b","start":10,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-e-p002c-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-9e7f1bade3933fa1462b","layer":"pei","quote":"淑旧居西豪里，县令苑康曰‘昔高阳氏有才子八人’，署其里为‘高阳里’。","attribution":"张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c347ca05b53d613cd76d","start":200,"end":234,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p002","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-9e7f1bade3933fa1462b","layer":"pei","quote":"张璠《汉纪》曰：“淑，博学有高行，与李固、李膺同志友善；拔李昭于小吏，友黄叔度于幼童。以贤良方正，征。对策讥切梁氏，出补朗陵侯相。卒官。八子：俭、绲、靖、焘、（诜）〔汪〕、爽、肃、旉。音敷。爽字慈明。幼好学，年十二，通《春秋》、《论语》。耽思经典，不应征命，积十数年。董卓秉政，复征爽；爽欲遁去，吏持之急。诏下郡，即拜平原相；行至苑陵，又追拜光禄勋；视事三日，策拜司空。爽起自布衣，九十五日而至三公。淑旧居西豪里，县令苑康曰‘昔高阳氏有才子八人’，署其里为‘高阳里’。靖字叔慈。亦有至德，名几亚爽，隐居终身。”","attribution":"张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":17,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c347ca05b53d613cd76d","start":0,"end":255,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
